ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Para qué estás recogiendo firmas?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡¿Para un club?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Eso animaría toda
la zona comercial.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} ¡Dame un boli!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}What are those signatures for?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}A live venue?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} That's a great idea!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm happy to sign.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bu imzalar ne için? Canlı müzik{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}} mekânı mı?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Harika fikir! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Memnuniyetle imzalarım.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Pardon?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} If that's for the club,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I think I've already signed it.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Here,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} 
I'll sign it again just in case.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Cómo?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Si es para un club,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
me parece que ya he firmado.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Pero
firmo otra vez por si las moscas.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Efendim?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bu kulüp içinse sanırım {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
daha önce imzalamıştım. Yine de {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}garanti {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
olsun diye bir kez daha imzalayayım.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}You got all the signatures you need!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
Congratulations,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Mayor!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I can't wait
for the new club to open.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}İhtiyacın olan tüm imzaları toplamışsın!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
 Tebrikler, Başkan{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}! Yeni {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}kulübün açılmasını
